rt of, apostrophe-initial 'cause = because; because both sides are expanded identically, only form differences are forgiven); ASCII apostrophes expand contractions like curly ones; abbreviations expand only at a word start.","Number-neutral: spelled cardinals, compounds, ordinals, decimals, scale words, comma thousands, percent, and currency share one digit form (twenty-five = 25, one thousand two hundred fifty = 1,250 = 1250, third = 3rd, three point five = 3.5, $5 million = five million dollars); spoken years with an eighteen/nineteen/twenty prefix (nineteen ninety nine = 1999, twenty twenty three = 2023) are read as years; plural/singular currency and decades are not normalized.","Error attribution enables the views cumulatively (disfluency, orthographic, number) on speaker-aware edit counts and reports the edits each step removed; remaining headline edits are classified by the aligned tokens as speaker attribution (a speaker-change token is involved), number/format (a substitution with a digit token), or other lexical. Attribution is order-dependent and a view can occasionally add edits (negative values).","Speaker metrics compare distinct provider speaker labels with reference speakers and report word attribution accuracy: the share of matched words in the neutral text-only alignment whose overlap-mapped provider speaker equals the reference speaker.","Alignment is an exact minimum-edit alignment with a checkpointed traceback, so substitution/deletion/insertion counts are exact for transcripts of any length."]},"normalization":{"lowercase":true,"contractionsExpanded":true,"abbreviationsExpanded":true,"currencySymbolsExpanded":true,"punctuationStripped":true,"fillerWordsRemoved":true,"neutralViews":["disfluency-neutral","orthographic-neutral","number-neutral"]},"duplicateGroups":[],"providerCount":8,"audioDurationSeconds":59,"providerGroups":{"local":{"count":8,"providers":[{"providerKey":"whisperfile/large-v2","provider":"whisperfile-large-v2","model":"large-v2